metadata/_tasks_geom = "TASK-059: HUGE-tank size bump (was TASK-058 scale 0.4 / pos.y 23.2). Boss feet SEATED on the (72,96) collision bottom (+48). 252px source >> collision so an integer scale is impossible; chose fractional scale 0.85 so the opaque idle reads BIG. Opaque idle bbox 53x123 @ (97,65); scale 0.85 -> ~45x105px tall (>= the 96px collision height; a touch of hitbox overhang is fine for a boss). Feet row (y=188 in source, frame 252) mapped to local y=+48 via position.y=-4.7; opaque centered on x=0. Collision stays byte-identical (72,96) — visual-size change only. Fine-tuning the on-screen size/seat is a later DIRECT playtest tweak."

